    "real_status_summary": "The project is a massive technical framework for a mobile RTS. It consists of over 120 files. The core gameplay loop (GameManager, ResourceManager, Unit/Building logic, AttackSystem) is fully implemented in C#. A functional Node.js backend with Colyseus is present, including a real-time Admin Dashboard for Superadmin control. While the architectural coverage is 100%, several high-level integrations (PlayFab, Firebase, Gemini) are implemented as functional skeletons with mock logic, designed to be swapped for production SDKs. Systems like Fog of War and Minimap are code-complete but require Unity Editor visual configuration."
